<!-- 我的反馈（2026-10 改版）：每条一组；状态用彩色文字；官方回复左边一条蓝线 -->
<view class="rec-page">
  <view wx:for="{{records}}" wx:key="id">
    <view class="gap"></view>
    <view class="grp fb">
      <view class="fbtop"><text class="type">{{item.typeLabel}}</text><text class="rs {{item.status === 'resolved' ? 'done' : item.status === 'processing' ? 'doing' : 'wait'}}">{{item.statusLabel}}</text></view>
      <view class="fbbody">{{item.content}}</view>
      <view class="fbdate">提交于 {{item.createdText}}</view>
      <view class="reply" wx:if="{{item.publicReply}}"><view class="reply-head">官方回复</view><view class="reply-body">{{item.publicReply}}</view><view class="fbdate" wx:if="{{item.updatedText}}">更新于 {{item.updatedText}}</view></view>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view class="empty" wx:if="{{!loading && !error && !records.length}}">还没有反馈记录</view>
  <view class="hint" wx:if="{{loading}}">正在加载…</view>
  <view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}<button bindtap="retry" size="mini">重新加载</button></view>
  <view class="hint" wx:if="{{records.length && !hasMore && !loading && !error}}">已显示全部反馈</view>
</view>
